      "markdownContent": "A copy of your application has been sent to the email address you gave and to the Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}**.\n\n## What happens next\n\n- The Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}** will review your application.\n- They may contact you if they need more information.\n- Submitting an application does not mean that a Hotel Licence has been granted.\n\nKeep your reference number for any follow-up."
